2. In this Order —
“Meetings”, in relation to any Organisation, means the Annual Meetings of the Board of Governors of the Organisation and any ancillary meetings thereto to be held in Singapore in September 2006;
“Official”, in relation to any Organisation, means —
(a)any Governor, Executive Director, Alternate, member of any committee or representative of the Organisation;
(b)any officer or employee of the Organisation; or
(c)any adviser to any person referred to in paragraph (a);
“Organisation” means any one of the following:
(a)the International Monetary Fund;
(b)the International Bank for Reconstruction and Development;
(c)the International Finance Corporation;
(d)the International Development Association;
(e)the International Centre for Settlement of Investment Disputes;
(f)the Multilateral Investment Guarantee Agency.
